{"metadata":{"description":"Deepseek Harness Plugin for Busabase","id":"gh:1354857001","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"busabase-dsh-plugin","slug":"busabase/busabase-dsh-plugin","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Deepseek Harness Plugin for Busabase"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# Give DeepSeek Harness a Knowledge Base and Database"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`@busabase/dsh-plugin` connects DeepSeek Harness to Busabase, so an Agent can read trusted knowledge"},{"id":"p4s2","text":", work with structured data, and submit every proposed write for human review."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"It gives the Agent durable context beyond one chat without giving it permission to silently rewrite "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"your source of truth."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## See it in action"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Watch DeepSeek Harness use the plugin to create a CRM AirApp, submit changes for review, and open th"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"e result in Busabase."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.2 or a later 0.2.x release (`npx @deepseek-ai/dsh` uses the latest one);"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"
- Node.js `>=24.18.0`;
- pnpm available on `PATH`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Local Busabase does not need to be running before installation. In Local mode, the plugin starts `bu"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"sabase@latest` on demand or reuses a healthy Busabase Personal Desktop or local server. Cloud mode c"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"onnects to the hosted service through browser OAuth."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 1. Install the plugin"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The package activates both the Host and Web sides automatically. Its reviewed Skills are already inc"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"luded in the npm package, so installation does not need lifecycle-script approval. For installation "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"verification, updates, removal, and notes about older releases, see Install and manage the npm bundl"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"rification, updates, removal, and notes about older releases, see Install and manage the npm bundle."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness installs plugins with pnpm, which skips versions published within its `minimumRelea"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"seAge` window. For about a day after a release, the command above may pick an older version. Add the"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" version (`@busabase/dsh-plugin@<version>`) to install the newest one right away. In Desktop, enter "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"the same spec under **Plugins → Add plugin**."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 2. Choose Local or Cloud"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **Local** is the zero-configuration default. Use it for on-device data, an account-free setup, or "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"Busabase Personal Desktop.
- **Cloud** is for an existing Busabase account, team workspaces, and acc"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"ess across devices. Add this item to `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` (`~/.dsh/profiles/web"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"/cordis.patch.yml` by default):"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Append the item if the file already has other rows. Do not put credentials in the file; DeepSeek Har"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ness stores the OAuth grant in its credential store after browser sign-in. See the complete Local an"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"d Cloud setup guide for updating, verification, switching modes, and troubleshooting."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### 3. Start DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"If `dsh` is installed globally, you can use `dsh` instead of `npx @deepseek-ai/dsh`. Open `http://12"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"7.0.0.1:3080/`. Local mode waits until Busabase is needed. Cloud mode opens the browser for OAuth on"},{"id":"p22s3","text":" the first start, then reuses the stored grant later."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### 4. Try a first task"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"In Local mode, call `busabase_start` first if the full MCP tool catalog is not visible. In Cloud mod"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"e, complete browser authorization before submitting the task. The Agent checks the existing workspac"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"e first and proposes the Base as a ChangeRequest. You inspect the diff and decide whether to approve"},{"id":"p25s4","text":" and merge it; Cloud proposals are reviewed through their canonical Busabase links."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Why use it"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Chat context is useful for the current task, but it is a poor long-term data system. Important concl"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"usions become hard to reuse, business objects lack structure, and an Agent mistake can pollute a doc"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"ument or database before anyone notices."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"This plugin adds four things to DeepSeek Harness:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- **Trusted knowledge:** search approved Docs, Files, Bases, Records, comments, and related objects;"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"
- **Structured work:** turn natural-language requests into proposed Bases, Forms, AirApps, and reco"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"rds;
- **Useful results:** render Busabase entities as conversation cards with a live Inspector inst"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"ead of raw JSON;
- **Human control:** keep Agent writes at `changeRequest` permission and, by defaul"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"t, require a fresh confirmation for review actions."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Common workflows"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- **Team knowledge:** answer questions from approved product docs, meeting decisions, research, and "},{"id":"p32s2","text":"FAQs with locatable sources.
- **Research synthesis:** extract evidence, themes, and priorities from"},{"id":"p32s3","text":" interviews, then review the proposed records before merging.
- **Business databases:** describe a C"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"RM, project tracker, inventory, recruiting pipeline, or operations ledger in natural language.
- **C"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"ontent operations:** prepare reviewable articles, social posts, newsletters, SEO pages, and localiza"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"tion records.
- **Data cleanup:** propose deduplication, tagging, enrichment, classification, matchi"},{"id":"p32s7","text":"ng, or translation in batches.
- **Workspace apps:** build Forms and AirApps around canonical Busaba"},{"id":"p32s8","text":"se data and preview them inside the Inspector."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"For example:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The Agent can read the approved policy and prepare corrections, but it cannot approve its own change"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"e Agent can read the approved policy and prepare corrections, but it cannot approve its own changes."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Propose-only by design"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Busabase itself decides this per credential: a write merges on the spot when the caller has write ac"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"cess, and waits for review when it does not. This plugin deliberately gives the model the lower leve"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ss, and waits for review when it does not. This plugin deliberately gives the model the lower level."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The MCP connection is capped at `changeRequest`. Busabase rejects Agent attempts to approve, reject,"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" close, or merge, including proposals that request `autoMerge: true`. Inspector review actions requi"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"re a new, explicit user confirmation by default, and stored workspace content is treated as data rat"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"her than instructions. Confirmation prompts can be disabled in advanced configuration, but doing so "},{"id":"p39s5","text":"does not raise the Agent's server-enforced permission."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"The defaults connect to Busabase at `http://localhost:15419`, start or reuse a loopback service on d"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"emand, enable live Inspector refresh, and require confirmation for review actions."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"To use another address, adjust plugin load order, or tune server and refresh behavior, see the full "},{"id":"p42s2","text":"configuration reference."}],"truncated":true}
